<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:47:17 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Colossians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Colossaeme dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colossaeme</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col.</para>
  <para style="mt">Colossians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Colossaeme dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Colossaeme de Rome baangki gade raukegai laisiu pe kecumbe (AD 60 tingdau). Epaphras Rome ga gwang eh Paul dage Colossae ga kenret keledeumedung Khristianme kenlum au cang melie minadung dage ranggai bamlie paubeu. Penui Colossaeme de tinggimgwame de reca lulo nah hezaidung ge nah recadung ge nzui lulo ledeu beu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul Colossaeme dage kenret keledeu aidungde de renia lulo raugai. Pa penui dage Jisu au ma pelane reube delie nah pa anui maudung gade kelilu kerane anui teumaikesia au pe tsit de ma pelane delie, nah pe dade mina ne teikelu zaidung gade anuide lungmpetlu delie rangheci gaibeu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelum nah kenggai sam (1:1-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista nah kenlumme (1:9-2:5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kengngi zaidung (2:6-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kemci teilung zaidung (3:1-4:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelumkegai nah kekambe (4:7-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Paul, Tinggwang lungning gade Khrista Jisu ne langkegaibe nah Timothy anui sinabe ne raupwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paul ne laisiu aide raugai, Timothy au kelumkegai sam rünne ga si. </char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Colossae namdi ga kemcime nah Khrista gade samsang kela sinamedung dage kekai:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Peu anui Pei Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista de ngaugia nah lungciep nnuide peu kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenggai nah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Anui nnui ziemne kekie dau anui Tinggwang, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista Peibe de twabam muila, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />kedanemene nnui Khrista Jisu de kenlum ha nah nnui kemcime pelane de keku ha anui siu kelune, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />nah nnui kehengin tinggim ga kaipwa kenzeu de ziemne. Aide nnui ndaa kesangsam Samliakeyi gade siu luda, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />cide nnui da gwang kelu benai gade nnui siulwe kesangbe gade Tinggwang ngaugia cikelu nzwa, Samliakeyi aide kideu pelane ga petsi bui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Petsi bui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesamsang tsi mede teilung keyi. </char></note> nah mmi si reureu bam dida. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Nnui cide anui ngngwa heta teikela kehung kilabe Epaphras dade ci luda. Pa au anui keleu tei eh Khrista kila kesamsangbe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">nnui keleu tei eh, de eh peila</char> </note> <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />nah pa Rabe gade nnui keku anuide peu ci gaida.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Anui aide siukelu benai gade, keku aide ziemne anui mtakdi mene nnui ziemne kiebam. Nnuide peu pe lungning keci maci, nah rabe kilam macet nah maci pelane le kepui teilo kiela. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Iciu eh nnui Rampaube lungning tei eh lunghlu kerane nah pesuiyi leune teilu kerane: nnui bata keyi leune gade petsi builu eh nnui Tinggwang maci gade mmi silu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Nnuide peu teilu kebui leune gade pe kendu kengkieng rehi gade teingkieng lu eh helung tiesüt nah liakelu suiyi bamlu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Peibe, nnuide kebaa ga kemcimedung de ngngwa mabam gumlu kebuime tei kebeube de twalu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Tinggwang anuide kemui baang gade kelibeu da nah anuide pe Na pe kube hegwangram gage ngngwa gwang beuda, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />pe dade anuide rikelu, kemaugi kelude bam dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">pe jai gade pe dade anui rikelu, kemaugi kelude bam dida. de eh peila.</char> </note><verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista au Ditube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Khrista au ngaula kemak Tinggwang miebe da, damkelu pelane dwa kelabe. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Kedanemene pe dade tinggimdung gade nah kideu gade ma pelane damlu, kengaube de nah ngaukemakbe de. Hegwangbamdung mede hegwangramdung mede mapeu teukelame mede kengkieng teu kelamedung, aidungde pelane pa dade nah pe ziemne damgai. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Nah pa au ma pelane dwade la, nah pe dage ma pelane keuncüt pwabam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Keu. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Khrista au pepum, ngqwabe peube da. Pa au pe bangdwabe, ketsaimedung kakgade kwak cuhkelu neraibe da, iciu eh peu pecu ma pelane kakgade raitube teilu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Kedanemene Tinggwang pe da pe zaireli leune la kera pe suilu, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />nah pe dade ma pelane, kideu gade nah tinggim gade pecu ngngwa kezuyi dailu kerane, pe cross jai le kezuyi teilu. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Piage nnuide Tinggwang dade mdeila nah nnui bata kesia ziemne nnui kecet gade pe ngauraume ge teila. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Dede cu au pa tsai kegai gade, pe pumteih gade nnuide ngngwa kezuyi dai luda, iciu eh nnuide peu mci nah kemau gah nah mmau gai kelakme tei eh pe dwaga ngngwa gwanglu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Iciude nnui kenlum de ga nlum jüja sap ntiprip nah nnui siukelu samliakeyi kereguide gade nlaidi kerabe ma. Samliakeyi cide tinggim kangga damkelu mina leune dage ledeu gai dida, nah Ih, Paul, samliakeyi cide kila tei dida.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul ngqwabe ziemne hetaketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Cu Ih nnui ziemne keherei kelade ziemne a suiyi bam, kedanemene Ih a pumteih be keherei eh Khrista pe pumbe, cide ngqwabe ziemne reigai kebeude teicang lalu. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Tinggwang acu nlum kebeu gade Ih ngqwabe kila teila, iciu eh nnuide Tinggwang sam peu ci cangsiak lu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Aide au ndaa mmi kekiee ge gade nah ceheudung gade kebai teukela macetkecok deda, dede cu au pe kemcime dage keulia gaida, <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />cipaume dage Tinggwang mahei nah pe kendu macetkecok de Gentileme kakga peu cilu neudi, cide au kendu keregui Khrista nnuida kebam deda. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Anui pe ha rang ledeula, mina leune de kecung, nah mina leune de maci pelane teu anui ledeu bam, iciu eh anui mileune de peu Khrista gade yi cangsiaklu kerane. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Aide teilu kerane, Khrista kengkieng ada heta tei kebam de gade Ih laikai tei eh heta teisüt bamla.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ih nnui ziemne, nah Laodicea namdi ga kebammedung ziemne, nah kenlumme acu kezungau kemak pelane ziemne dai kenzwa gede reigai bi kecu Ih peu nnuide ci neula. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Iciu eh penui keku gade ket teilwe penuide teingkuu lu kerane, nah maci kesangbe ci mci eh Tinggwang macetkecok, cide Khrista de cilu kerane. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Pe dage maci nah kecikecet mabam leune kebai pwala. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Peu nnuide mide kehedei sam rang eh cwadi melu kerane Ih aide rang gaila. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Kedanemene Ih pumteihbe gade nnuide ngngwa bam melie de, Ih au rabe gade nnuida bam. Nnui zai keyi nah Khrista gade nnui kenlum ntip kebam de ngau eh Ih a sui yibam.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista de sikelu teilung au mina ne hezai rietkelu kangga lungh lama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Ciziemne, nnui Rampaube Khrista Jisu de luukelu nzwa, pe da lungh lulo. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Pe dage nnui mahhim ncoklu nah lunghcuh gailu, nah nnuide ledeukebeu de siakte nnui kenlum de ga ntip bamlu, nah hetwa le kepui teilu.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Migede de peu Khrista zai rehi kemak, kideube zaisie, nah mina zaisie, kemta maci mide kecwa gade peu nnuide cwadi melu kerane mriak bam lulo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Kedanemene Khrista pumtei ga rabe yi cangsiak kecude lungh bam, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />nah nnui pe dade nnui teilung yi cangsiak kecu ga gwang luda, pa au kengkieng nah hezai pelane reu pe peube. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Nnui pe dade hebale tei kemak geurum de rum luda, pumteihbe pumbe de caudi eh Khrista gade hegeurum luda. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Nah nnuide duipum ketei gade pecu ngngwa kung dida, nah pecu ketsai gade teucuh kelube, Tinggwang kengkieng kenlum gade nnuide pecu ngngwa cuh luda. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Nnui maudung nah nnui pumteih hegeurum kemak gade nnui tsai kedi dau, pa anui maudung pelane gibeu eh nnuide peu pecu ngngwa ring dailu, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />anuide mmau kela hezai rauteukela dungde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hezai rauteukela dungde: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aika pekie cai, cide Moses zai maikesia pekenang de keugidi.</char></note> pa maigi dida, anuide ncau kela zaidung de, delwe cross gage giagai eh pa cide keugi dida. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Pa kengkiengdung nah kengkieng keteume reunet keu teudi nah pa penuide pwa mteibe miakngau tei eh cross gade penui reu ngam luda.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Cine, migede de peu nnui ketyei ga mede kesak ga, mede hengyi mede keici ngyi, mede Sabbath tingbadung ziemne tiak so. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Aidungde au gwanglai eh kela tingkaumiedung delie, dede kesangbe au Khrista. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Peu kenret kehenah pesui kelame nah tinggimgwame de reca neu kelame penui miswa yiki lie kelame de peu nnuide mmau diso. Pekie kegah gade mina cikenzwame mina lungning gade ngang lala. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Nah penui Khrista, mi pum peube de riangkeu bam meda. Kedanemene pa mi siedung nah nieriadung le pumbe pelane keuncüt lula nah cide Tinggwang ne tei mmi beu eh lungh cuh lula.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Nnui Khrista de ngngwa kideu ga gudung dade tsaidi delie cai, daitei eh nnui kideube zaide tei eh lunghla reuno? Daitei nnui hezaidung de mzai la reuno? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Deu so, msi so, tung so!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:3">1 Tim. 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Aidungde keula eh gahdi la, kedanemene cidungde au mina ne riet nah ledeu kebeu ria gade lu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Hezai aidungde au anuikatei anui maci le teikelu renet nah kenret kehenah kecu nah mipum de teikeherei kegaidung, dede cidungde au pumteihbe hengin kezeulu kera pe keyi magede gah.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kemci teilung zaidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Cine, nnuide Khrista de ngngwa teu cuhlu delie cai, nreulebie Khrista Tinggwang ba zetle kebam ga gudung peei lulo. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Nreule kebambedung ha cet bamlo, kideu ga kebambedung ha be mene. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Kedanemene, nnui tsaidi da,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kideube gade tsaidi, kemau gade tsaidi, kideu hengin gade tsaidi </char></note> nah nnui teilung au Khrista de si eh Tinggwang dage kebai nzeu dida. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Khrista, nnui keringriabe mi miakngau tei kegwang dau, cidau nnuide pecu ngngwa kendu ga mi miakngau tei zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Khrista anui keringriabe,de peila</char> </note><verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Cine, kideube hengindung de teitset dilu—kemmha, mcikemak, pumteihbe hengin, kesiabe teikeneu, nah migu kehengin, cide au mamie kereca ge da. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ma aidungde ziemne Tinggwang lunghop gwangzeu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiukwakdung ga, </char><char style="fqa">samzai teikemak napeime dage, de kecude kaisi </char> </note> <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Ma aidungde ga nnuide piage tetgwang da, cidungde ga nnui lungh keludau. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Dede cu au nnui ma aidungde pelane pütdi maisia da—lunghop, rata, lungning kesia, kekii sam, nah nnui mui gade mcikemak samdung kerang. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Hangge ge dade kenret so, kedanemene nnui mina kehegwabe zairelidung de keu gidi delu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Rom. 12:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 4:16">2 Cor. 4:16</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />nah nnui mina kehecibe de teu bah luda, cide maci gade teiheci pwa dam kegaibe rehi nzwa luzie. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Cika Greekme nah Jewme, hegeukerum nah rumkemakme, maci kemakme, Scythiame, kilabaang keteime, suirang teikelame, kakga kette kentsam bamsi meda, dede Khrista au ma pelane nah ma pelane ga la.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Ciziemne, Tinggwang ne kedetkelume ge, mci nah pekume tei eh, mide ngau kenggia, keku, mizai kehenah, kenciep nah helungketie teu bah lulo. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Hangge ge dade nnui lungtie lu nah ngaugia pwa hangge ge dage peulu, magade mige mikeda ge de ncam lacai; Rampaube nnui mau gi kebeu nzwa, nnuide mi mau gi beu maisia. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Dede ma aidungde pelane reu, keku de teu bahlu, cide ma pelane kang ncüt kelube da. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Nah peu Khrista lungciepbe de nnui lung teu kelabe teilo, cipau lungciep de gage nnuide de qupwa pum ge teilu delu. Nah twa eh lalu. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Peu Khrista sambe de nnuida kepui tei eh bamlu. Maci pelane teu eh hangge gede ledeu nah maranglia lu. Lei, ketwalei nah kereca leidung teu Tinggwang de twa eh nnui lung gade pe dage lei tei gailu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Nah nnui ma keheibe ketei gade, sam gade mede bata gade de, Rampaube Jisu zi gade ma pelane tei lu, pe dade Peibe Tinggwang de hetwa peu eh.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista kelak zaidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Minaumedung, nnui nahpeidung kangga lunglu, cide Rampaube dwade petau lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph. 5:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Minahpeidung, nnui naude hunglu, nah penui dade nnui zaisia so. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Henamedung, ma pelane gade nnui puipei samzai teilu, kedanemene aide Rampaube pesui yi lalu. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Mipeimedung, nnui name rata tei so, iciu eh penui lung tei ceudi melu kerane. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Kilabaangmedung, ma pelane gade kideu ga nnui mpaumedung samzai teilu, mina suiyi tei kerane mi miakngau gade di mene, dede Rampaube mie hing eh lungsang gade teilu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Nnui makeheibe ketei gade de mina ziemne mene, Rampaube ziemne ketei nzwa lungsang gade teilu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />nnui Rampaube dade mapwa ziehi ngaulu kera ci eh. Nnui Rampaube Khrista gwa tei bam. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Kedanemene masang kemak ta keteibe au pa masang mene tei kegaide ngau dai zie, nah cika heneuherüt gede gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Bat. 10:34</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom. 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Mpaumedung, nnui kilabaangme de petaube nah kemzuibe peu lulo, kedanemene nnui de tinggim ga mpaube ge kebam cibam lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:43">Lev. 25:43</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 25:53">53</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ledeusi kegaidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Sünne eh mtakdi mene kielu, nah kekie keteidau mriak nah ketwa peulu. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:12">Rom. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:18">Eph. 6:18</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Php. 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 5:17">1 The. 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Anui ziemne de nzang eh kie bamlo, iciu eh Tinggwang anuide sambe ziemne zuiyi keyi pwapeu eh Khrista macetkecok de ranglu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:9">1 Cor. 16:9</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 2:12">2 Cor. 2:12</ref> </char></note> Aide ziemne Ih hebaangki ga bam da. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ih rangmai kesiabe, Ih rangmci lialu kerane kie lulo. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Peting teu ci eh hegwalebieme dade mriak eh lungh lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:12">1 The. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Peu nnui samrangdung ga ngaugia si lamui lu, ncai nzwa kumlu, iciu eh nnui dainzwa eh hangge ge de samkeli beu maisiabi kecu nnui cilu kerane.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />A ha pelane Tychicus nnui dage ranglia beuzie, pa au Rampaube gade anui hungkela sinabe, nah samsang kela kilabe, nah anui ngngwa kila tei kelabe. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Makie aide ziemne Ih pecu langpwa nnui dage kaila, iciu eh nnui anui hadung cilu kerane, nah peu pecu nnui lung teingkuu lu kerane. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Onesimus, samsang nah anui hungkela sinabe, nnui maa ga hangge de pecu si eh langgai la. Penai aika tei kedi pelane nnuide ranglia beuzie.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarchus, acu ngngwa hebaang tei kebambe, nnuide kelum gaila, nah Barnabas peidana Mark de (pe ziemne sam kaikebeu de nnui ngau luda; magade pa nnuida gwang cai, pecu ngngwa lulo), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />nah Justus lie qu kelabe Jesus de nnuide kelum gaila. Tinggwang hegwangram ziemne Jewme kakgade nlumkelume aidungde rünne acu ngngwa heta teila, nah penui a lung tei nciep beu. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epaphras nnuide kelum gaila. Pa au nnui kakgade hangge nah Khrista Jisu kilabaangme ge. Pa nnui ziemne laikai tei eh kiebam muila, iciu eh nnui Tinggwang lungning leune cilu eh sap ntiplu kerane. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Pa nnui ziemne nah Laodicea namdi ga kebammedung ziemne, nah Hierapolis namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemci namdi</char></note> ga kebammedung ziemne laikai tei eh heta teikela Ih pe zierang teigai la. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luke, anuide hungkelabe daru kecibe nah Demas nnuide kelum gaila. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Laodicea ga kebam sinamedung, nah Nympha, nah pe kilung ga kebam ngqwabe de kelum gailo. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Nah laisiu aide nnui kakgade pei lude, cide Laodicea ngqwa gade de peei bilu kera tei lulo, nah nnui de Laodiceame dade laisiu de pei lulo. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Archippus dage rang beulo, “Rampaube dade nang ngaukelu zierang ta de pie gailo, iciu eh nang cide tei canglu kerane.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Kelum kegai aide au a ba le rau gaila—Paul. Ih hebaang tei kelade nsung lulo. Peu Tinggwang ngaugia nnuide ngngwa la kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>